# scripts/leak-check.exclude
#
# Glob list of relative paths (relative to the scanned root) that the
# leak check must skip. One glob per line; comments and blank lines are
# ignored.
#
# Keep this minimal. Prefer writing self-clean patterns (see the note in
# scripts/leak-check.patterns) and cleaning the offending value, and only
# exclude a path when it genuinely cannot be made clean — with a comment
# below saying why.

# (none)
